{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:40 2026-11-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:40 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:40 2026-11-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"「紫荊傳令」閘前W賠率着綠格至4.8倍得手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/edf412340dfc226923930633bcf88d6d/2026-11/m2_7.jpg\"/><p>麥文堅今日首天客串，即在第六場策游廄「紫荊傳令」報捷，替此馬打開在港勝門之餘，閘前W賠率更着綠格至4.8倍得手。</p><p>馬主陳國泰和太太李妮邀請行政會議議員任志剛齊拉頭馬。游達榮說：「我非常感謝馬主的耐心，今場麥文堅發揮很出色，我會安排此馬在拆禮物日再上陣。」<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:03:44.643718+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:40:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T21:17:49.574801+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:57:25.168708+00:00","content_hash":"a64a577375048204475b254e264d47fffb173cad164bc74eb96734beb4d497a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}